      "id": "ecb-daily",
      "title": "ECB daily native reference quote model",
      "description": "Preparatory model of ECB daily XML decoder output: FxReferenceQuote retains native required time, currency and rate strings and declares no stable key. EUR base and indicative-reference kind are source-definition context, without an invented base field or EUR quote row. Date/currency grain is scoped to one returned response; observation identities distinguish republications. Decimal digits and trailing zeros remain lexical. CC0 covers authored model metadata only; source execution, retention and paid applicability are not admitted.",
